      "value": "I took a look at OP's profile (bio) and took a guess. I assume this is about avatar audio on mobile platforms (Android & iOS), including Quest. This is currently not allowed for performance reasons on mobile platforms, voices take priority.\n\nAvatar audio already exists on the Windows platform (PCVR).\n\nPossible duplicate feature request, can be merged with:\n\n- https://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/returning-audio-sources-to-quest-devices-and-how-id-imagine-it\n\n- https://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/quest-audio\n\n- https://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/quest-avatar-audio\n\n- https://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/quest-audio-pls\n\n- https://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/allow-audio-sources-on-quest-avatars\n\n- https://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/avatar-audio-on-quest\n\n- https://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/audio-source-for-oculus-quest-1\n\n- https://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/bring-back-avatar-audio-for-the-quest\n\n- https://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/we-want-audio-back-on-quest\n\n- https://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/add-quest-sounds-back-and-be-better\n\nRelated:\n\n- https://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/local-player-avatar-audio-idea-quest",
